{"id":"wb-6-84","name":"谭家湾遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"谭家湾遗址","text":"谭家湾遗址位于浙江省桐乡市乌镇新春村谭家湾。遗址面积约8.75万平方米，中心点表土层厚1米左右，文化层厚约1.50米，属于新石器时代马家浜文化类型。\n\n1989年12月，被浙江省人民政府列为省级重点文物保护单位。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B0%AD%E5%AE%B6%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92160756,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92160756","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dfd53b07903dcad0108d5780.jpg","title":"谭家湾遗址c_20240407.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B0%AD%E5%AE%B6%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80c_20240407.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/%E8%B0%AD%E5%AE%B6%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80c_20240407.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​遗址内区域","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}